        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough* *cough*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not easy to control the strength and angle while I'm dealing with a person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I-It's okay. I'm fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Smells herself)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "My bleeding's stopped.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are they still so excited? Have there always been so many Sea Terrors here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are these the same monsters from last night?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "More or less.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never seen them before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You should stay away from this place for a couple of days. Now go back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Singer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop tugging my skirt... You aren't a child.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I just want to say... I think I know what it is that I want now. I want to hear you sing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's because... I don't know what songs are like. I heard you humming in your sleep, but I didn't understand it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Singer, will you do it? Is this what it means to make a promise?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "More or less.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Frowns)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "My harp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Oh yeah, singer, where did your harp go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go look for it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay. I'll help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So does this mean you'll come back with me? G-Great!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this something to be so happy about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
