    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_180#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Singer, welcome to our home sweet home again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_179#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... agh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Inhabitant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your grandmother...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Grandma Petra is still sleeping. She's been lying down ever since we got back last night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's probably tired, getting so worked up like that. I didn't expect her to run out and talk to the Inquisitor like that. She was different.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right. That was very amazing. She fought off the Inquisitor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_179#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmn... ha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Inhabitant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She fought off.. the Inquisitor?! Singer, if the Inquisitor catches you saying that, she'll be really mad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care if she does.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if she wants another go...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She won't come to you looking for trouble again, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter to me whose trouble she's looking for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Strokes case)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, yeah, why don't we go look for your harp?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You got stuff on your head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa! All this green, slimy stuff... W-What is this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's seaweed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Did it get on my head when I tripped?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Probably.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this stuff... useful in any way? Looks kinda like seagrass. Can I use it as bedding once it's dried? Grandma Petra's back is hurting her, so this will come in handy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Give it to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take some seashells and use them to grind up these seaweeds. Don't wash off the slime.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Add enough seawater to completely cover the seaweeds. Put it all in a jar and seal it up, then wait half a year.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can drink it once the liquid's greenish color has faded. That's when it's fermented.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Singer...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong? Is there something you didn't understand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No... I just don't think you've ever talked to me this much in one go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't throw away your seashells either. Wash them and lay them out to dry. You can use them to drink alcohol and such.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alcohol? What's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's written right there. This place used to be a bar, a place for alcohol.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So this word means alcohol!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alcohol can supposedly bring happiness and help us forget all our worries.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Does it work?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not at all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "It does taste pretty good, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you drink this stuff often back home...? Back in \u00c6gir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not exactly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would drink something similar before dances.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It must have been very fun. Oh, I get it now! Alcohol doesn't bring happiness, but we drink alcohol when we're happy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does everyone outside, uh, drink alcohol? Is everyone out there always so happy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not necessarily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I get it. They definitely aren't as happy as I am now. Singer, thanks for teaching me how to make alcohol. I really wanna drink it with you right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your hand movement is wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you grind it like that, it's not going to grind up very well. Try a different angle. Use the sharpest point and follow the seaweed's pattern.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Control your rhythm and your breathing... Make your hand and your whole body one with the sea breeze that's brushing against your skin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like that\u2014One stroke, and it's shredded.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You are staring at me. Do you still want another go? Now that there's only one of you, it'll be over very quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No... I don't think I will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is my harp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sheetmetal found it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "text": "He saw you drop it outside last night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, that's great! Singer, now we don't need to go look for your harp!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He brought it back to our house... and... and he told me to give it to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's all he said before he left...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187",
        "name2": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Plucks strings)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...? This melody... You were humming it while you were asleep last night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's always in my head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this a song that you and your partner used to sing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We have a lot of songs like this back home. We sing... as a way to talk to each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I left, the singing was gone too. I'm all by myself, and this song is all that I have left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No wonder this song sounds so sad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Plucks strings)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Singer, remember our promise?! You got your harp back. Does that mean you can sing for us now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're all waiting. Right, Grandma Petra?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_179#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmn... Uhh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Inhabitant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Grandma probably can't talk today. She would sing along with you if she could.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_179#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... Ahhh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Inhabitant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Singer, Grandma wants to hear your song.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
