    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_184",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I noticed a change in your expression. Did you feel something, perhaps?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bishop"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_184",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_184",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not a surprise. Your reflexes are still rather slow. Look at the water before you. The fluctuation of the level, the frequency of the waves, and the movement of its luster. All of these are information.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bishop"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll be high tide soon. We should go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bishop"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
