    },
    {
        "text": "She's singing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could she sing in front of these people in this rundown house?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor"
    },
    {
        "text": "And... they are listening to her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ones who hang their heads are still looking straight at the floor. The ones who don't speak are still silent as ever. Her singing has no way to reach their cold, hard husks, but their eyes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do they understand it somehow?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inquisitor"
    },
