    {
        "text": "Grandma Petra?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She... fell asleep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "text": "She never sleeps so peacefully. Most of the time, she starts screaming the moment she closes her eyes, grasping at nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought she'd want to dance when she heard you sing. I mean, she's always chirping about how she wants to dance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Drywall?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to die. There's seawater in my eyes... It's salty. Not tasty at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa... Are you... crying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crying? What is that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a kind of emotion that flows out from the deepest depths of your body...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_187"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is...? I don't think I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Singer, I like your songs. You don't like to talk, but you have so much to tell when you are singing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could you sing it again? I want to hear you talk about lots more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anita"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_180#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
